{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X的感受描写不如Y细腻具体，尤其缺少Y对音乐细节、身体反应和情绪微妙转折的同步呈现。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为普通观众，X的左右分区让我可以先跟住人物经历，再随意扫右侧感受，不必追赶一连串定时出现的文字；Y的加亮重点确实更醒目，但短时段里感受信息出现得太密，容易让人忙于追词。更重要的是，X把人物从离开、怀念、动摇到重新决定如何生活的心理因果交代得更完整，尤其保留了不愿为了留住亲近而再次吞下委屈这一核心立场。Y在音乐质感和情绪颗粒度上明显胜出，但局部描写的丰富还不足以弥补部分人物动机和前后心理联系被压缩的损失。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a73c6d78-cbd0-4f9a-ad1b-d1dec1b7fd39", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T115211362256Z", "elapsed_seconds": 135.89, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T11:54:27.271276+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9c94dfe72ffcbd6f340583cb017b46238a3ee11ab3047ca94928e22ca15eadb8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\c